:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MODS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT HELP='SRVMOD/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display description
:LISTACT HELP='SRVMOD/OPTIONS' OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Print description
:LISTCOL HELP='SRVMOD/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODNAME' VAR=MODNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Module
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODLIB' VAR=MODLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODATTR' VAR=MODATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODDATE' VAR=MODDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Creation Date
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODOPT' VAR=MODOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Optimization Level
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/MODDBG' VAR=MODDBG USAGE=OUTPUT.Debug Data
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SRVSRV BOTSEP=NONE KEYL=SRVKEYS HELP=DSPSRVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Service Program Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=42.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGM' VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Service program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMLIB' VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OWNER' VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMATTR' VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Service program attribute
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DETAIL' VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT.Detail
:DATACOL WIDTH=1.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SRVS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT HELP='SRVSRV/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display
:LISTCOL HELP='SRVSRV/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SRVNAME' VAR=SRVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Service Program
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SRVLIB' VAR=SRVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SRVACT' VAR=SRVACT USAGE=OUTPUT.Activation
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SRVSIG' VAR=SRVSIG USAGE=OUTPUT.Signature
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SRVEXP BOTSEP=NONE KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=DSPSRVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Service Program Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=42.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGM' VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Service program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMLIB' VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OWNER' VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMATTR' VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Service program attribute
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DETAIL' VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT.Detail
:DATACOL WIDTH=1.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&EXPHEAD.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=EXPS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.&EXPEMPTY.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PROCNAME' VAR=PROCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Procedure Name
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/ARGOPT' VAR=ARGOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.ARGOPT
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/DATANAME' VAR=DATANAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Data Item
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/DATASIZE' VAR=DATASIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Size
:LISTVIEW COLS='PROCNAME ARGOPT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='DATANAME DATASIZE'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* --- the module's displays
:PANEL NAME=MODBASIC KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPMODH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Module Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGM' VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Module
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMLIB' VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DETAIL' VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT.Detail
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMATTR' VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Module attribute
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=57.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Module information
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CRTDT' VAR=CRTDT USAGE=OUTPUT.Module creation date/time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRCF' VAR=SRCF USAGE=OUTPUT.Source file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRCFLIB' VAR=SRCFLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRCMBR' VAR=SRCMBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Source member
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SRCCHG' VAR=SRCCHG USAGE=OUTPUT.Source file change date/time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OWNER' VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CCSID' VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Coded character set identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MODTEXT' VAR=MODTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CRTDTA' VAR=CRTDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Creation data
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ILDATA' VAR=ILDATA USAGE=OUTPUT.Intermediate language data
:DATAI HELP='FLD/COMPILER' VAR=COMPILER USAGE=OUTPUT.Compiler
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OPTIONS' VAR=OPTIONS USAGE=OUTPUT.Creation options
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DBGVIEW' VAR=DBGVIEW USAGE=OUTPUT.Debug view
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DBGDATA' VAR=DBGDATA USAGE=OUTPUT.Debug data
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MODACTGRP' VAR=MODACTGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Activation group
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PEP' VAR=PEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Program entry procedure
:DATAI HELP='FLD/NBRPROC' VAR=NBRPROC USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of procedures
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STCSIZE' VAR=STCSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Static storage size
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CODESIZE' VAR=CODESIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code size
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CODEGEN' VAR=CODEGEN USAGE=OUTPUT.Code generator version
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=MODPROC KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=DSPMODH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Module Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGM' VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Module
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMLIB' VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DETAIL' VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT.Detail
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PGMATTR' VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Module attribute
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&PROCHEAD.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROCS SCROLL=YES.(The module has no procedures.)
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PROCNAME' VAR=PROCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=46.Procedure Name
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/PROCTYPE' VAR=PROCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Procedure Type
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/ARGOPT' VAR=ARGOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.ARGOPT
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPMODH.Display Module Information - Help
:P.A module's attributes: where its source came from, how it was
compiled, and its procedures. Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPGMH.Display Program Information - Help
:P.A program's attributes, one display per kind of detail: how and
when it was made, its size against the limits, the modules bound into
it, the service programs it binds to and what its activation group
exports and imports. Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPSRVH.Display Service Program Information - Help
:P.A service program's attributes, one display per kind of detail:
how and when it was made, its size, its modules, the service programs
it binds to, the procedures and data it exports and its signatures.
Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the displays; F12 goes back one display. F17 and F18
move to the top and the bottom of a list. F11 shows a signature as
characters instead of hexadecimal.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
