:HELP NAME='PGMMOD/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODNAME'.Module
:P.The modules bound into the program or service program.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODATTR'.Attribute
:P.The attribute of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODDATE'.Creation Date
:P.The date and time the spooled file was created.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODOPT'.Optimization Level
:P.The optimization Level of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODDBG'.Debug Data
:P.The debug Data of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PGMMOD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display description
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display description it.
:PT.6=Print description
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print description it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
